176 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 138 0 R
/E (This morning my wife and I breakfasted in our hotel overlooking the sea, surrounded by English and French visitors enjoying the comforts afforded to travellers of means. Having arrived comfortably by rail and steamer, I could not help but reflect upon how modern transport now allows businessmen such as myself to move across Europe with remarkable ease. After breakfast I visited a reading room frequented by merchants and investors, where discussion centred upon trade, railways, and Mediterranean commerce.)
/Pg 10 0 R
/K [3]
>>
