/P 140 0 R
/E (Later we walked together along the promenade overlooking the sea, surrounded by fashionable European visitors dressed in their finest clothing. France is beautiful, though I often notice how differently men and women experience such travel. While my husband enjoys freedom to explore and conduct business independently, I am expected always to remain composed, respectable, and suitably accompanied within public society.)
/Pg 12 0 R
/K [4]
>>
